This repository redistributes, unmodified, the skills platform-custom-field-generate, platform-permission-set-generate and
platform-validation-rule-generate of the salesforce-development plugin of forcedotcom/sf-skills
(https://github.com/forcedotcom/sf-skills), at commit face44b6bd3f02210d4d542106de9aa50f20d7aa, under the Apache License 2.0
(see LICENSE). Copyright (c) 2026 Salesforce, Inc.

Only that subset is copied, with the plugin's plugin.json; .claude-plugin/marketplace.json lists only that plugin. The copied
files are not modified. Nouter publishes this subset because a Nouter workspace cannot sync the full repository (it is too large).

Este repo redistribuye sin cambios esas tres skills de forcedotcom/sf-skills, bajo la licencia Apache 2.0, para que un espacio de
Nouter pueda sincronizarlas: el repo original es demasiado grande para sincronizarlo entero.
